<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>월덕 명품관 & 가상경제 소비 센터 | Wolduck Luxury Hub</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #07090e;
      --bg-surface: #0d121d;
      --bg-card: rgba(19, 26, 42, 0.75);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(27, 37, 59, 0.9);
      --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --border-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);
      --primary: #6366F1;
      --primary-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
      --accent-gold: #F59E0B;
      --accent-gold-glow: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
      --accent-emerald: #10B981;
      --accent-purple: #A855F7;
      --accent-cyan: #06B6D4;
      --accent-rose: #F43F5E;
      --text-main: #F3F4F6;
      --text-muted: #94A3B8;
      --font-family: "Pretendard", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: var(--font-family);
      background: var(--bg-dark);
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 100% 100%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 50% 30%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.06) 0px, transparent 50%);
      color: var(--text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* 📢 실시간 확성기 전광판 티커 */
    .ticker-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2), rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2));
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
      padding: 10px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }
    .ticker-badge {
      background: var(--accent-gold);
      color: #000;
      font-weight: 900;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-gold-glow);
    }
    .ticker-content {
      flex: 1;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      color: #E2E8F0;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .ticker-btn {
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
      color: var(--accent-gold);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .ticker-btn:hover {
      background: var(--accent-gold);
      color: #000;
    }

    /* 네비게이션 */
    .navbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      background: rgba(13, 18, 29, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }
    .nav-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .nav-link {
      padding: 8px 14px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {
      color: #fff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1320px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 28px 20px 60px;
      flex: 1;
    }

    /* 헤더 히어로 & 유저 프로필 카드 */
    .shop-hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 27, 75, 0.6), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8));
      border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 30px 36px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .shop-hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -20%;
      width: 350px;
      height: 350px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25), transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 900;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #c7d2fe);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .hero-desc {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      max-width: 600px;
    }
    .user-stat-card {
      background: rgba(11, 14, 20, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
    }
    .user-avatar-wrap {
      position: relative;
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      padding: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #ec4899);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .user-avatar-wrap img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .user-info-text .label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--accent-gold);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .user-info-text .cash-val {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #FDE68A;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .user-info-text .sub-val {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* 탭 네비게이션 */
    .tabs-nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .tabs-nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .tab-btn {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .tab-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: #fff;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .tab-btn.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3));
      border-color: #6366f1;
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);
    }

    /* 탭 콘텐츠 영역 */
    .tab-pane {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .tab-pane.active { display: block; }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* 그리드 카드 레이아웃 */
    .grid-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .item-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }
    .item-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      border-color: var(--border-glow);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .card-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .item-icon-box {
      font-size: 32px;
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }
    .rarity-tag {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .rarity-COMMON { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); }
    .rarity-RARE { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3); }
    .rarity-EPIC { background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.15); color: #f472b6; border: 1px solid rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.3); }
    .rarity-LEGENDARY { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: #fbbf24; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25); }

    .item-title {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .item-desc {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      min-height: 40px;
    }
    .item-duration {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .item-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      padding-top: 16px;
    }
    .item-price {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #34d399;
    }
    .btn-action {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #4f46e5);
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-action:hover {
      transform: scale(1.04);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.5);
    }
    .btn-action:disabled {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: #64748b;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      box-shadow: none;
      transform: none;
    }

    /* 덕하우스 & 쇼케이스 룸 */
    .duckhouse-hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9), rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .pedestal-slot {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      min-height: 140px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .pedestal-slot:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent-gold);
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
    .pedestal-slot.filled {
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6));
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
    }

    /* 로또 번호판 */
    .lotto-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(46px, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
      max-width: 540px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .ball-btn {
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .ball-btn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.1);
      border-color: #6366f1;
    }
    .ball-btn.selected {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F59E0B, #EF4444);
      color: #000;
      border-color: #F59E0B;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.6);
      transform: scale(1.12);
    }

    /* 드릴 대장간 애니메이션 */
    .drill-anvil {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
    }
    .drill-icon-bounce {
      font-size: 64px;
      display: inline-block;
      animation: drill-bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes drill-bounce {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-12px) rotate(-8deg); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .container { padding: 14px; }
      .shop-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 20px; gap: 16px; }
      .user-stat-card { width: 100%; justify-content: flex-start; }
      .tabs-nav { gap: 6px; }
      .tab-btn { padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 13px; }
      .items-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
      .house-slots-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(130px, 1fr)) !important; }
      .dressing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
      .lotto-board-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
      .forge-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .navbar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 14px; }
      .nav-links { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; width: 100%; }
      .ticker-bar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
      .ticker-btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- 📢 실시간 확성기 전광판 티커 -->
  <div class="ticker-bar">
    <div class="ticker-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn"></i> 실시간 확성기</div>
    <div class="ticker-content" id="tickerMsg">
      ✨ 월덕 가상경제 소비 시스템 v1.0 정식 가동! 주간 명예 상점, 컬렉션 제작소, 덕하우스 확장 및 로또 6/45가 열렸습니다!
    </div>
    <button class="ticker-btn" onclick="openMegaphoneModal()"><i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> 확성기 송출 (5만원)</button>
  </div>

  <!-- 상단 네비게이션 -->
  <header class="navbar">
    <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
      <span style="font-size: 24px;">🦆</span> 월덕 가상 경제
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="/" class="nav-link">홈</a>
      <a href="/stock" class="nav-link">주식 거래소</a>
      <a href="/casino" class="nav-link">카지노 룸</a>
      <a href="/shop" class="nav-link active">🛍️ 명품 상점</a>
      <a href="/admin/spending" class="nav-link" style="color:#a855f7;">👑 관리자 관제</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- 상점 헤더 히어로 -->
    <div class="shop-hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1 class="hero-title">🛍️ 월덕 명품관 & 가상경제 소비 허브</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">화폐를 소모하여 주간 명예 외형을 획득하고, 미사용 아이템을 분해하여 나만의 덕하우스와 황금 컬렉션을 완성하세요.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="user-stat-card">
        <div class="user-avatar-wrap" id="userAvatarWrap">
          <img src="<%= user ? (user.avatarUrl || 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/0.png') : 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/0.png' %>" alt="Avatar">
        </div>
        <div class="user-info-text">
          <div class="label">보유 현금 잔액</div>
          <div class="cash-val" id="userCashDisplay"><%= Number(userCash || 0).toLocaleString() %>원</div>
          <div class="sub-val" id="userShardHeaderDisplay">🪶 황금 깃털 조각: <b>0개</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 탭 메뉴 -->
    <div class="tabs-nav">
      <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('tab-prestige')"><i class="fa-solid fa-gem"></i> 주간 명예 상점</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-workshop')"><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i> 컬렉션 제작소</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-duckhouse')"><i class="fa-solid fa-landmark"></i> 덕하우스</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-cosmetics')"><i class="fa-solid fa-palette"></i> 외형 드레싱 룸</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-honor')"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown"></i> 상설 명예 & 오라</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-lotto')"><i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i> 로또 6/45</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-forge')"><i class="fa-solid fa-hammer"></i> 드릴 대장간</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-inventory')"><i class="fa-solid fa-box-open"></i> 내 보관함</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 🌟 1. 주간 명예 상점 탭 -->
    <div id="tab-prestige" class="tab-pane active">
      <div style="margin-bottom: 24px; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="color:#a5b4fc; font-size: 17px; margin-bottom:4px;">✨ 주간 로테이션 명예 상점</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:13px;">체험형 닉네임 컬러부터 초호화 성운 테두리 및 전설 배지까지 매주 새롭게 변경됩니다. (구매액 100% 영구 소각)</p>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:12px; color:#c7d2fe; font-weight:800; background:rgba(99,102,241,0.25); padding:8px 14px; border-radius:10px; border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.4);">
          🔄 매주 월요일 00:00 KST 정기 로테이션
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="prestigeCatalogGrid" class="grid-cards">
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted); padding:30px;">명예 상점 카탈로그를 불러오는 중입니다...</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 🔨 2. 컬렉션 제작소 & 분해소 탭 -->
    <div id="tab-workshop" class="tab-pane">
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap:20px; margin-bottom:28px;">
        <!-- 보유 재료 카드 -->
        <div style="background:var(--bg-card); border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.4); border-radius:20px; padding:24px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245,158,11,0.1);">
          <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--accent-gold); font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">내 보유 제작 재료</div>
